                                <h4>Register your business</h4>
                                <p>Create your account in minutes. Verify your phone via WhatsApp OTP. Set your business type — plumbing, fashion, electronics, whatever you sell.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hiw-step">
                            <div class="hiw-step-num">2</div>
                            <div class="hiw-step-content">
                                <h4>Upload your product catalog</h4>
                                <p>Add products with images, sizes, brands, and prices. Organize into categories. No limits on how many products you list.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hiw-step">
                            <div class="hiw-step-num">3</div>
                            <div class="hiw-step-content">
                                <h4>Share your link via WhatsApp</h4>
                                <p>Get a unique shop link. Share it to customers directly or enable auto-share so every catalog request goes out automatically.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hiw-step">
                            <div class="hiw-step-num">4</div>
                            <div class="hiw-step-content">
                                <h4>Receive orders, prepare & mark ready</h4>
                                <p>Orders land on your dashboard. Prepare the items. Mark as "Ready for Pickup." Customer gets notified. They come in, pay, and leave happy.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hiw-visual">
                        <div class="hiw-mock-label">Orders Inbox — Emeka's Shop</div>
                        <div class="hiw-mock-card">
